---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHero from '../../components/PageHero.astro';
import ContactSection from '../../components/ContactSection.astro';

// Reviews are carried over from the live page, word for word (spelling and grammar included),
// with names shortened to first and last initials (owner's decision, Oct 28). The live page
// shows no dates or sources, so none are shown here.
// Left out: two reviews that were not from clients (the plan names them): one from a lawyer who
// has had cases against the firm, and one from a person the firm does not represent.
// Ethics screen for Bryn: LEO 1750 section G bars testimonials about results or comparisons.
const title = 'Recent Client Testimonials - Pathfinder Injury Law';
const description =
  "Pathfinder Injury Law is here to help win your Virginia workers' compensation case. Check out recent client testimonials or give us a call.";

const reviews = [
  { by: 'R.A.', text: `Gave me a free consultation, then took care of every aspect of my case. Always kept in touch and updated me on the status of my case. Would definitely highly recommend Pathfinder Injury Law.` },
  { by: 'M.L.', text: `Mr Swartz is a professional to the core and you get good value/ results with him representing you. He works with his client’s best interest at heart which gives some peace of mind while dealing with injury and other related issues.` },
  { by: 'S.W.', text: `Pathfinder Injury Law fought hard to save my case and get me my weekly benefits and settlement I deserved and more. I was pushed and shoved into a corner with my previous council, Bryn Swartz and Mandy Truman truly care about their clients and will make sure you are taken care of and have a complete understanding of everything Workmans Compensation doesn’t want you to know. Bryn still checks in on me to make sure I’m doing alright or need anything still to this day, thank you again Bryn and Mandy, wouldn’t be on my feet and back to my life without you guys!` },
  { by: 'B.A.', text: `My husband was injured at work , we contacted Bryn and Mandy because we had never been thru anything like this before . Bryn and Mandy were wonderful to work with and very professional. We can’t thank them enough for all of there help and knowledge.` },
  { by: 'C.M.', text: `Bryn was very professional. He took time to explain every process and the possible outcomes to help in making informed decisions. This is a very responsive injury law firm and will recommend contacting him especially if you don’t have a clue about navigating your case` },
  { by: 'T.B.', text: `The team at Pathfinders was very professional, attentive and knowledgeable. Mr. Swartz made certain that I understood my rights and walked me through the process. I highly recommend their services.` },
  { by: 'M.W.', text: `It has been an absolute pleasure working with Pathfinder Injury Law. They guided the way when I needed help the most. Very knowledgeable, respectful of my situation and always there whenever I had questions. Highly recommend for anyone who needs good honest professional legal representation.` },
  { by: 'B.K.', text: `Amazing service, very respectful, honest. They Helped guide me in the right direction even when they couldnt help me themselves. Best service I’ve experienced over the phone in a long time.` },
  { by: 'A.J.', text: `I had a great experience with him. He was very quick on responses and very precise with what I needed done. He did it a very timely fashion. Great guy as well.` },
  { by: 'J.C.', text: `Bryn is an excellent attorney and a fierce advocate. He knows how to get results and works hard for his clients. He is an excellent litigator and negotiator, and is a significant asset when fighting for your workers’ compensation benefits.` },
  { by: 'K.W.', text: `Pathfinder Injury Law was extremely helpful, knowledgeable, personable, and ensured that I understood each step of the process. You cannot go wrong with Pathfinder, a professional firm that doesn’t just say they care… but show they CARE!!` },
  { by: 'J.H.', text: `If you want a straight-talking attorney, no bluster or sides-stepping, you want Bryn Swartz. Having worked with Bryn I can tell you that he provides his clients with clear and comprehensive information about their cases. To ensure that his clients understand the dynamics of their cases, Bryn explains the process so there will be no surprises. Having been a workers’ compensation claimant in the past, I made the mistake of representing myself-never again. Should I ever have that misfortune in the future, I would not hesitate to call Bryn. His knowledge of the law, and of people, is enriched by the breadth of his experience. Bryn navigates his clients skillfully through a system which can prove confusing and overwhelming.` },
  { by: 'J.W.', text: `Bryan and Mandy not only have the experience, and education necessary, but the empathy to understand what you’re going through. They build relationships and favorable outcomes for their clients. I’d 100% recommend to anyone else.` },
  { by: 'C.C.', text: `Compassionate, caring, and professional. I have worked with Bryn and Mandy on a couple occasions and they have always been strong advocates for my best interest. I would highly recommend to anyone in need of their services!` },
  { by: 'C.I.', text: `If you need Professional Lawyer who can get it done and treat you like family. They have truly been an asset to my case. Give them a call today don’t put it off get the help you need!` },
  { by: 'L.J.', text: `This legal team is knowledgeable, trustworthy, and above all caring of their clients. They treat your case as if you were family and that’s all one can ask for in our most vulnerable moments. I strongly recommend anyone in need to reach out to this amazing legal team!` },
  { by: 'A.R.', text: `When I found myself in a hard spot this firm truly helped me get back on a path to success. Other attorneys that I have used before have always felt cold and it seemed all they wanted was my money but Pathfinder was completely different. They were able to keep a very professional relationship throughout the process but at the same time I felt as if they wanted what was best for me just like a close friend. The first time I met with Pathfinder I was nervous about moving forward. My excuse was that maybe things would just get better on there own if I gave it more time. I remember Bryn looking at me and quoting Andy Warhol “ They always say time changes things, but you actually have to change them yourself” that gave me the courage to move forward.` },
  { by: 'T.H.', text: `Used this law firm recently and WOW! Anytime I had questions they were available and answered them immediately. Truly felt like they cared and had my best intention at hand! Definitely would recommend to anyone and will use again if the need rises! *5/5 STARS*` },
  { by: 'R.A.', text: `Could not ask for a better group of people to work with! Very knowledgeable and on top of your case. Kept me informed every step of the way and answered all of questions and concerns did not feel like a number very personal touch.` },
];
---
<Base
  title={title}
  description={description}
  path="/reviews/"
  crumbs={[{ name: 'Recent Client Testimonials', path: '/reviews/' }]}
  overlay
>
  <PageHero title="Recent Client Testimonials" crumbs={[{ name: 'Recent Client Testimonials' }]} />

  <section class="section reviews-section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="review-wall">
        {reviews.map((r) => (
          <figure class="review-card" data-reveal>
            <svg class="stars" viewBox="0 0 100 18" role="img" aria-label="5 star review" focusable="false">
              {[0, 1, 2, 3, 4].map((i) => (
                <path transform={`translate(${i * 20} 0)`} d="M9 .9l2.5 5.7 6.2.6-4.7 4.1 1.4 6.1L9 14.2l-5.4 3.2L5 11.3.3 7.2l6.2-.6z" />
              ))}
            </svg>
            <blockquote><p>{r.text}</p></blockquote>
            <figcaption>&ndash; {r.by}</figcaption>
          </figure>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <ContactSection />
</Base>

<style>
  .reviews-section {
    padding-top: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4.5rem);
  }
  .review-wall {
    columns: 1;
    column-gap: 1.5rem;
  }
  @media (min-width: 46rem) {
    .review-wall {
      columns: 2;
    }
  }
  @media (min-width: 66rem) {
    .review-wall {
      columns: 3;
    }
  }
  .review-card {
    break-inside: avoid;
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
    background: var(--mist);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: 1.75rem;
    border-top: 0.4rem solid var(--sun);
  }
  .stars {
    width: 7.5rem;
    height: auto;
    fill: var(--amber);
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .review-card blockquote {
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
  }
  .review-card blockquote p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }
  .review-card figcaption {
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--pine);
  }
</style>
